  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Information has been Redacted in accordance with the two principled exceptions of the Foreign Aid Transparency and Accountability Act (FATAA) of 2016; including the health and security of implementing partners, as well as national interest of the United States.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity relates to Ukraine and strives to support the following illustrative program-funded costs: salaries of US, FSN, and TCN and other staff such as PSCs, RSSAs, PASAs, CASUs working for the US Government managing, administering, and supporting programs and their program-funded benefits.</narrative>
